# Claude Code keeps its git worktrees here - whole checkouts of this repo,
# a quarter of a gigabyte of them. Never commit it.
.claude/

# What the After Effects regression suites write when they run. Every run
# rewrites them with a fresh timestamp, so tracking them puts a diff in front
# of you for work you did not do. The suites that produce them sit beside
# them, and the numbers that matter go in the commit message.
Vertex Rig tests/*-results.txt
